@startuml Bootloader_Architecture
title BootloaderTool architecture — host stack -> UART -> ST ROM bootloader -> flash

left to right direction

package "Host — BootloaderTool (.NET 8)" {

  package "UI" {
    [Avalonia GUI\nMainWindow + ViewModel] as GUI
    [CLI\nCliRunner + verbs] as CLI
  }

  package "BootloaderTool.Protocol" {
    [FactoryResetSession\nerase->write->verify->go\n(state machine)] as Session
    [An3155Client\nSync / Get / GetId / Erase /\nWrite / ReadRegion / Go] as Client
    [FirmwareImage + Crc32] as Image
    interface ISerial
    [SerialPortAdapter\nSystem.IO.Ports, 8E1] as Adapter
  }
}

GUI --> Session : Factory Reset
CLI --> Session : factory-reset / upload
CLI --> Client : info / list / verify / read / go
Session --> Client
Session --> Image : load + CRC32
Client ..> ISerial : uses
ISerial <|.. Adapter

node "STM32F407G-DISC1" {

  package "ST ROM bootloader @ 0x1FFF0000\n(AN3155, protocol v3.1)" as ROM {
    [UART command parser\n0x7F / Get / Erase / Write / Read / Go] as BLparser
  }

  package "App firmware @ 0x08000000" as APP {
    [BootloaderEntry\nCheckAndEnterBootloader\nTriggerFactoryReset] as Entry
    [Application\nProcess: button + UART 'R'] as App
    [Button (PA0) / Led (PD12/PD13)] as IO
  }

  database "Flash 1 MB\nsectors 0-11" as Flash
  [RTC BKP0R\nfactory-reset magic] as BKP
}

Adapter --> BLparser : UART 8E1, USART3\nPB10/PB11 (TTL-232RG)
BLparser --> Flash : erase / write / read-back
BLparser ..> APP : Go -> 0x08000000

App --> IO : poll PA0 / blink
App --> Entry : on trigger
Entry --> BKP : write magic + reset
Entry --> BKP : read / clear magic (boot)
Entry ..> ROM : JumpToSystemMemory()\n(magic present)

@enduml
